title: $:/mf/gen/GUI command/file:zoom
catalog: GUI command
target: file:zoom
summary: File: zoom the previewed image/video

!! Reference

* Defined by the ``file`` panel

!! Default keys

* ``-`` → ``file:zoom out`` (in the ``file`` panel)
* ``0`` → ``file:zoom reset`` (in the ``file`` panel)
* ``=`` → ``file:zoom fit`` (in the ``file`` panel)
* ``plus`` → ``file:zoom in`` (in the ``file`` panel)
